ks/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" alt="" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ijZ7OTX2FSks/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;厄尔尼诺现象正在袭击世界上最大的食糖生产国，暴露了该作物对气候现象的严重脆弱性，但也让人们初步了解了&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/5kxpbk54Kl3tMgZQ__ioZOupYgbSXJXa2nQiiYIGOrAiCV6YorxJo7VEuu2CPn8pwmCmG2Hbo1TewEVQ-L4IGS5LH_jJEz9K_Wi_vMSsXu2J_cWZVfTne0WUJM6IZ5C7v5T8tjaJN4q_magztjVhQJBWrPsRmiprAei2G7gqnX2z0sPv-yqCLCJp_zOicYplajroqHuCS38bYN4G9x_RMDLOosR7iub6__7vujxbavSL8-WBZ0q_Nt2ftxs8WeFeAYqEV6_AfbSjx6C6e1nWrvMkATU7Gv5GtAwCFmt4vVPnDz4avn_yUX2qIhqIxmRzBi_cZAV7BCJId77P_wgadV3OLXiVjoPhKXTND5-DZeB76QTLisEtlzXAgbEvNwgRjvT_mfdOwV4cdJ3gSlJpDfa2JyZWcxl5AhRdH6gGOMyv1HEbKG47gnj4jr1nq7rVvPcCLijTllF54cqbn_TKYBSYamDRCJN5_kpwPf1TB-sASphnoF0C6YE1tNaXi2aJSD0w-tVzi_VONxwffxvMNWTzD2z3hIjCI15CYOlEQAjNx49axluNmhYYx9Saj--DbbEYq_fU/5LUY7Xu0jpPghdP3X2UQUrVe1N5ovS9J/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="超级厄尔尼诺现象将导致本季糖过剩转为赤字"&gt;对农民和全球粮食通胀的更广泛威胁&lt;/a&gt;。它为甜味剂制造了一场完美的风暴：南半球种植区的降雨加剧，同时赤道以北的干旱加剧。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;最后&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;随着气候变化，地球各地的冰川都在萎缩，但&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/YahVHDX0Kg5kgj8xCpAAuTZE7bXtb2CmA0m1hpWl3ZRBeN3IaB0k1s1cNLWUromQbaif32DCrnF3o16R2G9Ef7REXKjYwTRcvkHhNEk-mjkbrqhQWVDApZj6KGMxjNzDV_TuvP3YE6oXUeIXOGf0EQ12NAem2LChLWcYJN71-qYxmAFNERWnvJbtUNM5i4zRLCOBEuPKiAw1aGklV3ISIu9YZx2Euzr74AL4AbhsopikgjYv789GKBDiApzLHCtGR5yKNL3mJHkAlboiDg6IItIS0JX0BP2FypjtmJfmftHFQMB94ICUGWzSMYDdT-